    {
      "text": "Line chart “F. 3.5 – Surgical procedures (major)” for each month of 2019. Procedures jump from about 3 in January to about 45 in February and 53 in March, then fall to about 2–6 per month for the rest of the year.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
